tory Jurisdictions": "Australia, EU, UK, United States (state-level), Canada", "Primary Use Case": "Fiat onboarding for exchanges, wallets, and Web3 applications", "Primary User Segment": "Retail users; exchanges, wallets, and dApps embedding on-ramps", "Primary Value Flow": "Fiat → Stablecoin / ETH → Ethereum", "Reason for Inclusion": "Banxa meets Global On-Ramp criteria by providing multi-country fiat → Ethereum asset conversion at scale, with access and onboarding as its primary function rather than trading or settlement.", "Regional Restrictions": "Yes (jurisdiction-specific compliance limits)", "Regulatory Model": "Licensed / Partner-Licensed (jurisdiction-dependent)", "Role Relative to Ethereum": "Access Gateway / Distribution Layer", "Supported Crypto Assets": "ETH, major stablecoins (USDC, USDT), select ERC-20 tokens", "Supported Fiat Currencies": "USD, EUR, GBP, AUD, CAD, and numerous local currencies", "Supported Payment Methods": "Credit/Debit Cards, Bank Transfers, Local Payment Rails", "Systemic Importance to Ethereum Access": "Medium–High"}, "source_label": "Global On-Ramps"}'::jsonb),
